; Filelist generation script using BlitzList (c) Anthony Brice 1996

; This is a test script tailored around my system for generating lists as I
; don't run a bbs anymore. It saved me a load of typing via cli doing it this
; way so I've left it in the distribution for anyone else wanting to use it as
; an example for themselves if they intend to use BlitzList for generating
; lists for other purposes, rather than just BBS filelists.

Ram_0:BlitzList bb2:My-Code/BlitzList/Config/Test.cfg 

; End of script.

